   "title": "Interior Design",
   "intro": "Calm interior spaces with ambient lighting embrace the new Gran Turismo’s design ethos of simplicity or “Kanso”. The forward section flows to an island berth with ample storage while the convertible midship berth offers a lovely versatile space for movie night, for storage, for a quick nap, or whatever you feel up to.\nThe fullsize head and shower that will remind you of the comforts of home. Thoughtful touches like ambient lighting, integrated reading lights, and soft-close drawers highlight the boat’s attention to detail, making the Gran Turismo 40 a perfect blend of sophistication and practicality for modern cruisers.",
